name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-postassessment-q14_2026-pilot'

question 'A student finishes a project and reflects: "I used AI to generate my first draft, then I rewrote most of it, fact-checked every claim, and added my own analysis and examples." Which statement BEST evaluates this process?'

wrong 'This is an example of over-relying on AI, because the student should have written the first draft themselves.'
right 'This is a strong example of human-led AI use, where the student maintained critical control and responsibility for the final product.'
wrong 'This process is only acceptable if the student disclosed their AI use to their teacher first.'
wrong 'The student\'s fact-checking was unnecessary, because rewriting the draft is sufficient to make it their own work.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lessons 3, 9
MARKDOWN
